# ReelForge

Read `AGENTS.md` at the project root first (Part 1: making videos, Part 2: the code). Task guides
live in `skills/`; the `get_guide` tool reads them.

Use the `reelforge` MCP server (`.cursor/mcp.json`) and look at `preview_frames` images before you
say an episode is done.
